  FT["BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016"] = {"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam (AGC) — LAWS OF BRUNEI / Government Gazette","sourceUrl":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-11","articleCount":14,"structureMode":"SECTION","title":{"zh":"所得税法修正命令 2016","en":"INCOME TAX ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2016","orig":"INCOME TAX ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2016","vi":"Sắc lệnh sửa đổi Luật Thuế thu nhập năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมพระราชบัญญัติภาษีเงินได้ พ.ศ. 2559","id":"Perintah Perubahan Undang-Undang Pajak Penghasilan Tahun 2016","ms":"Perintah Pindaan Akta Cukai Pendapatan 2016"},"level":"law","status":"active","issuingBody":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam","completenessNote":"来源为 AGC 官方 PDF《S-15_2016_E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016.pdf》（10 页），本次切分 14 条。该 PDF 为扫描件 + OCR 文本层，正文按版式位置重建：已剔除页眉页脚与边栏条标题、回接折行；未改写措辞、未增删内容。OCR 层面可能存在个别粘连或形近字，逐字引用请以原始 PDF 为准。","textQuality":"ocr-scanned","sourceFile":"S-15_2016_E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016.pdf","country":"BN","countryName":"文莱","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"heading":{"en":"Citation"},"text":{"en":"This Order may be cited as the Income Tax Act (Amendment) Order, 2016."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"heading":{"en":"Amendment of section 10 of Chapter 35"},"text":{"en":"Section 10 of the Income Tax Act, in this Order referred to as the Act, is amended by adding the following two new subsections - \"(4) There shall be exempt from tax any income ,of a person relevant to year of assessment 2015 and the subsequent years of assessment if its gross sales or turnover during the basis period does not exceed $1,000,000.\n\n(5) For the purpose of subsection (4), gross sales or turnover include revenues from the sale of goods, rendering of services, interests, royalties and dividends.\"."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"heading":{"en":"Amendment of section 13"},"text":{"en":"Section 13 of the Act is amended -\n\n(a) in subsection (I), by deleting \"one-fifth\" from the last line and by substituting \"40%\" therefor;\n\n(b) in subsection [2) -\n\n(i) in paragraph (a), by deleting \"one twenty-fifth\" from the second last line and by substituting \"20%\" therefor;\n\n(ii) by deleting paragraph (b), and by substituting the following new paragraph therefor - \"(b) Where, at any time in or after the basis period for the first year of assessment under this Act, the interest in a building or structurc which is thc rclcvant intcrcst in relation to any expenditure is sold while the building or structure is an industrial building or structure, the annual allowance, in the years of assessment the basis periods for which end after the time of that sale, shall be computed by reference to the residue of that expenditure iln~lleciialcly alter the sale and shall be\n\n(i) the fraction of that residue, the numerator of which is one, and the derlominator of which is the number of years of assessment comprised in the period which begins with the first year of assessment for which the buyer is entitled to an annual allowance or would bc so entitled if the building or structure had at all material times continued to be an industrial building or structure, and ends with the fiftieth year after that in which the building or a structure was first used; or\n\n(ii) 20% of that residue, whichever is the greater, and so on for any subsequent sales;\""}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"heading":{"en":"Insertion of new section 16C"},"text":{"en":"The Act is amended by inserting the following new section immediately after \"Industrial and manufacturing allowance for machinery and plant 16C. (1) Notwithstanding sections 16 and 16B, where a person carrying on a trade, profession or business incurs capital expenditure on the installation of machinery or plant for the productio~~ of products by any of the industries specified in the Fifth Schedule, he shall, in lieu of the allowances provided by section 16 and section 16B, be entitled for an annual allowance of 100% in respect of the capital expenditure incurred.\n\n(2) Where a person proves to the satisfaction of the Collector that- he has incurred capital expenditure during the basis period relevant to the year of assessment on the installation of machinery or plant for the production of products by any of the industries specified in the Fifth Schedule, there shall be allowed on due claim, in addition to the allowance provided by subsection (I), an additional allowa~lce at the rate of 50% of the capital expenditure incurred on the provision of that machinery or plant.\n\n(3) Any claim for allowances under this section shall be made at the time of lodgment of the return of income for the relevant years of assessment or within such further time as the Collector may allow.\n\n(4) Where any allowance has been claimed and allowed under this section for any year of assessment, no allowances shall be made in any subsequent year of assessment under any other provision of this Act, in respect of such expenditure.\n\n(5) Where any allowance has been made to any person under subsection (2), in respect of any machinery or plant and the person disposes off the machinery or plant within the period of one year from the provision of such machinery or plant, any allowance made under subsection (2), shall be brought to charge as if the allowance was not made, and be deemed as income for the year of assessment relating to the basis period in which the disposal occurs. The provisions of section 62 shall, so far as may be, apply, accordingly. The period of 6 years specified in that section shall be reckoned from the end of the year of assessment relevant to the basis period in which the disposal was discovered.\n\n(6) Such person shall give notice to the Collector of such disposal 30 days of the disposal.\n\n(7) This section shall apply to machinery and plant installed between the 1st day of January 2014 and 31st day of December 2019.\n\n(8) Tax credit under section 42B shall not be available in respect of plant or machinery entitled to allowance under this section.\"."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"heading":{"en":"Amendment of section 17"},"text":{"en":"Section 17 of the Act is amended, in subsection (4) -\n\n(a) in paragraph (b), by deleting the full stop and substituting a semicolon\n\n(b) by adding the following new paragraph -- \"(c) the amount of allowances, if any, allowed under sections 16B and 16C.\"."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6."},"heading":{"en":"Amendment of section 78"},"text":{"en":"Section 78 of the Act is amended, in subsection (l)(b), by inserting \"16C(6),\" immediately after \"section\" in the first line. of new Fifth Schedule"}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7."},"heading":{"en":"CONSTITUTION OF BRUNEI DARUSSALAM"},"text":{"en":"The Act is amended by inserting the following new Schedule immediately after the Fourth Schedule - % 'Ct - Continued"}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15."},"text":{"en":"Sheet metal-forming Roofing, walling, fencing, roof trusses, frames, fitting and fixtures, ducting, containers for storage and transport, other related building materials."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16."},"text":{"en":"Manufacture of The of and and turbine-generator and complete turbine-generator and engine sets, switchgear and switchboard apparatus, rectifiers, other electrical transmission and distribution equipment, electrical and equipment, electrical industrial control devices such as motor starters and controllers, electro-magnetic clutches and and industrial apparatus."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17."},"text":{"en":"Slaughtering, preparing and Abattoirs and halal meat packing preserving halal meat plants; dressing and packing cattle, sheep, lambs, poultry and rabbits. Included are processing and packing activities such as curing, smoking, salting, pickling, packing in air-tight containers and quick-freezing. The manufacture of sausage casing, halal meats soups, halal meat puddings and pies and other edible halal animal fats are also included."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18."},"text":{"en":"Manufacture of non-metallic of mineral products non-metallic mineral products, such as and product; mineral wool; slate products; cut-stonc products; abrasives; graphite products; silica and all othcr nonasbestos. SCHEDULE - Continued"}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A19","no":19,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 19."},"text":{"en":"Manufacture of The of and and communication sets, equipment and apparatus reproducing and recording equipment, public systems, gramophones, dictating machines and tape recorders; gramophone records and pre-recorded magnetic tapes, wire and wireless telephone and telegraph and transmitting, signaling, and detection and equipment and installations; parts and supplies specially used for electronic apparatus classified in this group; semi-conductor and related sensitive semi-conductor devices; fixed and and condensers; radiographic, fluoroscopic and other x-ray apparatus and tubes."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20."},"text":{"en":"Manufacture of The manufacture of telephone and data communication equipment electronically over wires or through the air such as radio and television This class includes: - manufacture of switching equipment; - manufacture of cordless telephones; - manufacture of (PBX) equipment; - manufacture of and telephone answering machines; - manufacture o f data communications equipment, such as bridges, routers and gateways; - Continued - manufacture of transmitting and receiving antenna; - manufacture of cable television - manufacture of pagers; - manufacture of cellular phones; - manufacture of communication equipment; - manufacture of radio and television - and - manufacture' of modems, carrier - manufacture of burglar and fire alarm systems, sending signals to a - manufacture of radio and television - manufacture of infrared devices (e.g. remote controls)."}},{"id":"BN-S-15-2016-E-INCOME-TAX-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2016-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21."},"text":{"en":"Manufacture of other articles The manufacture of household and of paper and paperboard personal hygiene paper and cellulose wadding products: - cleansing tissues; - handkerchiefs, towels, serviettes; - toilet paper; - sanitary and napkins and napkin liners for - cups, dishes and trays; - manufacture of textilc wadding and of towels, tampons etc; - manufacture of printing and writing paper ready for use; - n~anufacture of computer printout paper ready for use; - manufacture of - manufacture of duplicator stencils and carbon paper ready for use; - manufacture of or adhesive paper ready for use; - manufacture of and - manufacture of accounting books, binders, albums and and commercial stationery; - manufacture of boxes, pouches, wallets and writing compendiums containing an assortment of paper - manufacture of and similar wall coverings, including vinyl-coated and textile wallpaper; - manufacture of labels; - manufacture of filter paper and - manufacture of and paperboard bobbins, spools, cops etc;"}}],"pack":"bn-p25","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1801-BN-1261","source":"INCOME TAX ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2016","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
